+NO TRAINING, no optimizer step.  run_bs.py ran only through main(... "--preflight-only") against a temporary root with
+run_bs.run replaced by a function that raises (nothing could start); run_waves_bs.sh was not run.  <BS>/APPROVED was NOT
+written.  Every write is under <BS> (my scripts and outputs in <BS>/review/fixer).  Nothing pushed or merged.
+The five tools (run_bs.py, read_bs.py, run_waves_bs.sh, bs_common.py, bs_hooks.py) and <BS>/code were NOT edited, so V1
+was not re-run (the rule re-runs it only after an edit to them).
