+negative control, criteria_sha256 not the file's: ["APPROVED: criteria_sha256 '1111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111' != sha256(criteria.txt)"]
+score_bs PROVISIONAL items on the temporary root: ['code copy /tmp/claude-0/-home-user-mesozoic-labs/184ee67c-2802-5235-8e52-6dc7daa72cd3/scratchpad/r10round/bias_screen/review/fixer/preflight_root/code missing: not measured']
